post.description:
Sample Response:

    {
        "bearerToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
        "apiToken": "T0FQSS1iODQzMDc2NS1kMTJjLTQ0MDAtNjE="
    }
            
Returns the customer API Authentication Bearer Token and API Endpoint Security Token.

Sample Requests:

     {
       "make": ["ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING"]
     }
Get a list of all market trends data for "ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING" makes.

     {
       "make": ["ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING"],
       "model": ["G550", "1125SPX", "BBJ3"]
     }
Get a list of all market trends data for "ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING" makes and models "G550", "1125SPX", "BBJ3".

     {
       "make": ["ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING"],
       "yearmfr": "2000:2008", <em> year range mfr/dlv year use "{start_year}:{end_year}"</em>
       "yeardlv": "2008", <em> single year mfr/dlv year use "{entered_year}"</em>
       "categorysize": ["MJ", "ABJ", "LGULR"]
     }
Get a list of all market trends data for "ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING" makes with categorysize "MJ", "ABJ", "LGULR" yearmfr between 2000 and 2008.

 OR
 
Get a list of all market trends data for "ASTRA", "GULFSTREAM", "BOEING" makes with categorysize "MJ", "ABJ", "LGULR" yeardlv = 2008.


<b>Output Fields:</b><table ID="docModelMarketIntel" border="0"><tr><td><b>FIELD</b></td><td><b>DESCRIPTION</b></td></tr><tr><td>responseid</td><td>Unique ID assigned to every response. Note that all responses will include a response ID.</td></tr><tr><td>responsestatus</td><td>Indicates the status of the response generally starting with phrase “Success: ” or “Error: ” followed by words if appropriate adding detail.</td></tr><tr><td>count</td><td>The count of the total number of model trend records returned.</td></tr><tr><td><b>modelIntelligence</b></td><td><b>Repeating list of aircraft Model Intelligence records returned from search results.</b></td></tr><tr><td>model_icao</td><td>Model ICAO type value.</td></tr><tr><td>model_id</td><td>Unique model ID assigned to each aircraft model.This model ID can then be used to select specific aircraft of interest using getAircraftList request.</td></tr><tr><td>model_airframe_type</td><td>Type of airframe returned as FixedWing or Rotary.</td></tr><tr><td>model_make_type</td><td>Make type of the aircraft model returned as JetAirliner, BusinessJet, Turboprop, Piston, or Turbine.</td></tr><tr><td>model_make</td><td>The make of the aircraft which typically includes names like Gulfstream, Falcon, Citation, etc.</td></tr><tr><td>model_name</td><td>Model name of the aircraft.</td></tr><tr><td>model_manufacturer</td><td>Name of the manufacturer for the model.</td></tr><tr><td>model_weight_class_name</td><td>Weight class of the aircraft as Heavy, Medium, Light, Very Light.</td></tr><tr><td>model_category_size</td><td>Category size of the aircraft model returned as ABJ, CJAL, CTAL, LGJ, LGLR, LGULR, LJ, MJ, MEP, METP, PJ, SEH, SEP, SETP, SLJ, SMJ, TEH, or VLJ.</td></tr><tr><td>model_category_size_name</td><td>Category assigned to the aircraft as Large Jet, Mid-Size Jet, Light Jet, Large Long-Range Jet, Single Engine Piston, etc.</td></tr><tr><td>model_fuselage_length</td><td>Fuselage Length</td></tr><tr><td>model_fuselage_height</td><td>Fuselage Height</td></tr><tr><td>model_fuselage_wing_span</td><td>Wing Span <em>* F</em></td></tr><tr><td>model_fuselage_width</td><td>Fuselage Width <em>* R</em></td></tr><tr><td>model_cabinsize_height</td><td>Cabin Height in decimal feet</td></tr><tr><td>model_cabinsize_width</td><td>Cabin Width in decimal feet</td></tr><tr><td>model_cabinsize_length</td><td>Cabin Length in decimal feet</td></tr><tr><td>model_cabin_volume</td><td>Cabin Volume</td></tr><tr><td>model_baggage_volume</td><td>Baggage Volume</td></tr><tr><td>model_pax</td><td>Number of passengers</td></tr><tr><td>model_max_range</td><td>Range</td></tr><tr><td>model_field_length</td><td>FAA Field Length</td></tr><tr><td>model_cruise_speed</td><td>Normal Cruise TAS</td></tr><tr><td>model_max_speed</td><td>Vmo (Max Op) IAS</td></tr><tr><td>model_total_costs</td><td>Total Direct Costs</td></tr><tr><td>average_total_asking_price</td><td>Model average asking price.</td></tr><tr><td>average_total_days_on_market</td><td>Model average days on market.</td></tr><tr><td>average_total_airframe_time</td><td>Model average airframe time.</td></tr><tr><td>average_total_engine_time</td><td>Model average engine time.</td></tr></table>
